  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dfac47ee224b874bb19eaf86a0bd0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogues:
  - "Hi there! Let\u2019s learn how to use the toilet."
  - When your tummy feels funny or full, it means you might need to go. Walk calmly
    to the bathroom.
  - "Sit on the toilet seat with your feet flat.  Take your time. There\u2019s no
    need to rush. "
  - When you're done, use toilet paper to wipe from front to back. Put the paper
    in the toilet. Not on the floor.
  - Press the flush button once. All clean! Good job.
  - Next, turn on the tap and get your hands wet. Use some soap and rub your hands
    together.
  - Wash the front, the back, and between your fingers. Keep washing while you count
    to twenty.
  - "Rinse your hands with clean water. Dry them with a towel or paper. That\u2019s
    it! You did great today. "
  - "Remember \u2014 using the toilet and washing hands keeps you healthy and strong."
  audioClips:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 882a9ea9123e5484fa610ac8e49cd2b8, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d139845188b02ba47ae4203ef0983c5f, type: 3}
